<tr><td class="py-3 px-4"><code class="text-cyan-400">build</code></td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">1.071</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.526</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.481</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.488</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right text-gray-400">2.23&times;</td></tr>
<tr><td class="py-3 px-4"><code class="text-cyan-400">filter</code></td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">1.285</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.653</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.564</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.642</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right text-gray-400">2.28&times;</td></tr>
<tr><td class="py-3 px-4"><code class="text-cyan-400">each</code></td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.859</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.477</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.084</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.466</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right text-gray-400">10.23&times;</td></tr>
</tbody></table></div>
<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3">DateTime</h2><p class="text-gray-400 mb-4">One enormous Soli win (<code class="text-cyan-400">parse</code> &mdash; Ruby's <code class="text-cyan-400">Time.parse</code> is famously slow) against consistent losses elsewhere; every Soli DateTime operation allocates an object.</p>
<div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 mb-10"><table class="w-full text-left text-sm"><thead class="bg-white/5 text-gray-300"><tr><th class="py-3 px-4">Operation</th><th class="py-3 px-4 text-right">Soli</th><th class="py-3 px-4 text-right">Ruby</th><th class="py-3 px-4 text-right">+YJIT</th><th class="py-3 px-4 text-right">+ZJIT</th><th class="py-3 px-4 text-right">Ratio</th></tr></thead><tbody class="text-gray-400 divide-y divide-white/10">
<tr><td class="py-3 px-4"><code class="text-cyan-400">parse</code></td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">4.608</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">153.059</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">135.576</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">145.348</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right text-emerald-400 font-semibold">0.03&times;</td></tr>
<tr><td class="py-3 px-4"><code class="text-cyan-400">format</code></td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">7.045</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">5.898</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">5.903</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">5.894</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right text-gray-400">1.20&times;</td></tr>
<tr><td class="py-3 px-4"><code class="text-cyan-400">subtract_days</code></td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">3.502</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.829</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.863</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.808</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right text-gray-400">4.33&times;</td></tr>
<tr><td class="py-3 px-4"><code class="text-cyan-400">add_hours</code></td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">3.561</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.833</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.832</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.793</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right text-gray-400">4.49&times;</td></tr>
